# Browsable HTML renderings of ROADMAP.md, AUDIT.md and PLAYTEST.md, for reading
# in a browser rather than in a diff. Presentation only: every fact in them is in
# the tracked Markdown, so a deleted .reports/ costs nothing, and
# scripts/gen_reports.py rebuilds all three.
.reports/

# Bytecode from importing scripts/gen_reports.py, which is the only Python here.
__pycache__/

# Screen captures and video of the game, kept locally and deliberately not
# versioned. The video alone is 113 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit for a
# single file, so a commit would be rejected and the blob would stay in history.
screenshots/
